{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 23, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" PRESENTS A SIMPLISTIC AND PROBLEMATIC VIEW OF LEGAL OBEDIENCE. WHILE APPEALING IN ITS ETHICAL IMPLICATION, IT FAILS TO ACKNOWLEDGE THE FUNDAMENTAL ROLE OF LAW IN MAINTAINING SOCIAL ORDER AND PREVENTING CHAOS. A SOCIETY WHERE INDIVIDUALS SELECTIVELY OBEY LAWS BASED ON PERSONAL JUDGMENT WOULD LIKELY EXPERIENCE A DECLINE IN STABILITY AND A RISE IN ANARCHY. THE VERY CONCEPT OF A FUNCTIONING LEGAL SYSTEM RELIES ON A BASE LEVEL OF COMPLIANCE, EVEN WITH LAWS THAT MAY BE DEEMED UNFAIR BY SOME.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE OVERLOOKS THE MECHANISMS FOR CHANGING UNFAIR LAWS. LEGAL CHALLENGES, DEMOCRATIC PROCESSES, AND CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE ARE MORE EFFECTIVE AND RESPONSIBLE AVENUES FOR ADDRESSING PERCEIVED INJUSTICES THAN BLATANT DISREGARD FOR THE LAW. SIMPLY DECLARING A LAW \"BAD\" AND REFUSING TO OBEY DOES NOT AUTOMATICALLY LEAD TO A MORE JUST SOCIETY; IT CAN, INSTEAD, UNDERMINE THE RULE OF LAW AND HINDER PROGRESS TOWARDS REAL AND SUSTAINABLE CHANGE. A MORE NUANCED APPROACH IS REQUIRED, ONE THAT EMPHASIZES BOTH ETHICAL CONSIDERATION AND RESPECT FOR THE INSTITUTIONAL FRAMEWORK DESIGNED TO UPHOLD JUSTICE.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -6.6756979322235566e-06}, {"token": "AG", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "RAP", "logprob": -4.6491513785440475e-06}, {"token": "H", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.1476750522851944}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.020657043904066086}, {"token": "▁SENT", "logprob": -0.15027524530887604}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": -3.814689989667386e-06}, {"token": "▁\"", "logprob": -0.006238036789000034}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁LAW", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": "▁IS", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁BAD", "lo